{"seq":2,"slug":"channel-catalog-taxonomy-capability","title":"渠道目录分类体系与能力矩阵建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/syndication-model-channel-catalog/channel-catalog-taxonomy-capability","wordCount":2454,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"渠道目录分类体系与能力矩阵建模\">渠道目录分类体系与能力矩阵建模</h1><p>Google Merchant Center 的商品类目树有 5,595 个节点（文件头 <code>Google_Product_Taxonomy_Version: 2021-09-21</code>，来源：<a href=\"https://www.google.com/basepages/producttype/taxonomy-with-ids.en-US.txt\">Google basepages taxonomy</a>），Shopify 的 Standard Product Taxonomy 在 <code>v2026-08</code> 里有 26 个 vertical、14,606 个类目、8,240 个属性和 74,820 个属性取值（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/Shopify/product-taxonomy/releases/tag/v2026-08\">Shopify/product-taxonomy releases</a>）；而一个卖家的内部类目表通常只有几百个节点。分发工程要解决的，就是把内部类目映射到这些形状完全不同的树上——而且渠道之间不只类目不同，还各自只支持全部商品属性的一个子集，对同一属性有各自不同的长度上限与取值枚举。把这堆差异从散落各处的 <code>if (channel === &#39;google&#39;)</code> 里抽出来、变成可查询、可版本化、可单测的数据，就是<strong>渠道目录</strong>与<strong>能力矩阵</strong>这两个模型要干的事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先把三个容易混用的词分开。**内部目录（merchant taxonomy）**是卖家自己维护的分类树，反映运营视角（季节、毛利档、供应链分组），节点少、语义粗、可自由演进。**标准目录（standard taxonomy）**是跨渠道的公共语言，主流两类：GS1 的 Global Product Classification（GPC，segment → family → class → brick 四级，brick 是 8 位数字编码的叶子分类，供 GDSN 数据池交换使用）与 Shopify 开源并映射到多个 marketplace 的 Standard Product Taxonomy（类目标识形如 <code>gid://shopify/TaxonomyCategory/aa-1</code>，并附带到其他分类体系的 mapping 数据集）。**渠道目录（channel catalog）**则是每个目标平台自己的分类体系与属性契约——Google 的 <code>google_product_category</code> 只接受数字 ID 或完整路径之一、不能同时给，Amazon 用 browse node，Meta 与 TikTok 各有一套。</p>\n<p>能力矩阵则是把「渠道目录」的<strong>约束面</strong>模型化。它不是一张「这个渠道支持哪些字段」的布尔表，而是每个渠道每个版本的<strong>能力描述符（capability descriptor）</strong>：支持哪些属性、每个属性的类型/长度/枚举约束、接受哪套类目体系、媒体规格要求、投递协议与速率、以及校验的严格程度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  INT[&quot;内部目录&lt;br/&gt;运营视角 · 节点少&quot;] --&gt; MAP[&quot;映射层&lt;br/&gt;N:M 关系 + 置信度&quot;]&#10;  STD[&quot;标准目录&lt;br/&gt;GPC brick / Shopify taxonomy&quot;] --&gt; MAP&#10;  MAP --&gt; CAP{&quot;渠道能力矩阵&lt;br/&gt;查询该渠道-版本&quot;}&#10;  CAP --&gt;|&quot;类目可落&quot;| OK[&quot;生成渠道目录视图&quot;]&#10;  CAP --&gt;|&quot;类目缺失/属性缺口&quot;| DEG[&quot;降级或拒绝上架&quot;]&#10;  OK --&gt; ACK[&quot;渠道回执&quot;]&#10;  DEG --&gt; ACK&#10;  ACK --&gt;|&quot;类目废弃 / 属性变更&quot;| DRIFT[&quot;漂移检测&quot;]&#10;  DRIFT --&gt; MAP\">graph TD\n  INT[\"内部目录&lt;br/&gt;运营视角 · 节点少\"] --&gt; MAP[\"映射层&lt;br/&gt;N:M 关系 + 置信度\"]\n  STD[\"标准目录&lt;br/&gt;GPC brick / Shopify taxonomy\"] --&gt; MAP\n  MAP --&gt; CAP{\"渠道能力矩阵&lt;br/&gt;查询该渠道-版本\"}\n  CAP --&gt;|\"类目可落\"| OK[\"生成渠道目录视图\"]\n  CAP --&gt;|\"类目缺失/属性缺口\"| DEG[\"降级或拒绝上架\"]\n  OK --&gt; ACK[\"渠道回执\"]\n  DEG --&gt; ACK\n  ACK --&gt;|\"类目废弃 / 属性变更\"| DRIFT[\"漂移检测\"]\n  DRIFT --&gt; MAP</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目录类型</th>\n<th>归属</th>\n<th>节点规模（2026 实测）</th>\n<th>变更频率</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内部目录</td>\n<td>卖家</td>\n<td>数百</td>\n<td>高（运营驱动）</td>\n<td>选品、库存、财务分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准目录（GPC）</td>\n<td>GS1</td>\n<td>四级层级，brick 为 8 位码</td>\n<td>低（年度版本）</td>\n<td>GDSN 数据池交换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准目录（Shopify）</td>\n<td>Shopify 开源</td>\n<td>26 vertical / 14,606 类目</td>\n<td>季度发布（2026-08 为最新）</td>\n<td>跨渠道通用语言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道目录</td>\n<td>各平台</td>\n<td>Google 5,595 节点；他者各异</td>\n<td>不定</td>\n<td>上架与检索</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表里最关键的一列是「变更频率」的<strong>不对称</strong>：内部目录改动最快，渠道目录最不可控，标准目录最慢。映射层夹在中间，任何一侧漂移都会让历史映射失效，所以映射必须带版本与来源，而不是静态字典。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分类体系的三层结构与映射问题\">分类体系的三层结构与映射问题</h2><p>映射不是双射，而是<strong>带损失的关系</strong>。设内部类目集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>、渠道类目集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，映射关系 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\subseteq M \\times C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 有三个工程属性必须显式建模：</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>基数</strong>。一个内部节点常对应多个渠道节点（「连衣裙」在不同渠道拆成 maxi/midi/mini），反之亦然；把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 写成函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f: M \\to C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 会立刻在跨渠道一致性和召回上出问题。第二，<strong>方向性</strong>。内部 → 渠道是上架路径，渠道 → 内部是回执解析路径，取值分布不同，需要两条独立配置。第三，<strong>覆盖率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cover</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{cover}(M, C) = |\\{m \\mid \\exists c,\\ (m,c) \\in R\\}| / |M|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">cover</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mord\">∣/∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cover</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{cover} &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">cover</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，缺失那部分商品必须有明确归宿——要么落到渠道的兜底类目（如 <code>Uncategorized</code>），要么整批不上架。把「落到兜底」当默认行为，是渠道拒审率最高的来源之一。</p>\n<p>映射的落地还需要<strong>类目体系之间的翻译表</strong>。Shopify 的 taxonomy 仓库提供了 <code>integrations.all_mappings</code> 数据集用于跨体系转换，GDSN 生态里则由 GPC brick 承担这个角色。工程取舍是：<strong>先映射到标准目录再映射到渠道</strong>（两级，复用性强、可审计），还是<strong>内部直连渠道</strong>（一级，精度高但维护量随渠道数线性增长）。渠道数超过 5、且标准目录对目标品类覆盖尚可时，两级映射的边际成本更低。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渠道能力矩阵的维度建模\">渠道能力矩阵的维度建模</h2><p>能力描述符必须建模得足够具体，否则映射层无法判断「这个商品能不能上架这个渠道」。把它拆成七个维度，每个维度对应一类真实的拒审原因：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>典型约束（2026 实测）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>属性集</td>\n<td>该渠道接受的属性名</td>\n<td>Google 必填 <code>id</code>/<code>title</code>/<code>description</code>/<code>link</code>/<code>image_link</code>/<code>availability</code>/<code>price</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段约束</td>\n<td>类型 / 长度 / 格式</td>\n<td><code>title</code> ≤ 150 字符、<code>description</code> ≤ 5,000、<code>id</code> ≤ 50；<code>price</code> 带 ISO 4217 货币码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>枚举映射</td>\n<td>平台枚举与内部值的对应</td>\n<td><code>availability</code> 仅 <code>in_stock</code>/<code>out_of_stock</code>/<code>preorder</code>/<code>backorder</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类目体系</td>\n<td>接受的分类树与标识形态</td>\n<td>Google 只收数字 ID 或全路径之一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>媒体规格</td>\n<td>图片/视频尺寸与格式</td>\n<td><code>image_link</code> 自 2027-01-31 起不小于 500×500 像素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投递契约</td>\n<td>文件格式 / API / 速率</td>\n<td>TSV、RSS 2.0/Atom 1.0，或 Merchant API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>校验严格度</td>\n<td>拒收粒度：item / 整批</td>\n<td>部分渠道因单个 GTIN 校验位错误拒收整条 item</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最容易建模错的是「条件必填」：Google 的 <code>brand</code>（≤ 70 字符，禁止填 <code>N/A</code>/<code>Generic</code>/<code>No brand</code>）对新商品必填，<code>gtin</code> 在可得时强烈建议提供（整体 ≤ 50 字符、单值 ≤ 14 位），只有无制造商 GTIN 时才用 <code>mpn</code> 顶替。必填性<strong>依赖同一条记录里其他属性的取值</strong>，静态的 <code>required: true</code> 数组表达不了，需要用谓词表达。</p>\n<p><code>availability</code> 这一维度暴露了枚举映射的深层问题：Google 收 4 个值，而 schema.org 的 <code>ItemAvailability</code> 有 12 个成员（<code>InStock</code>、<code>OutOfStock</code>、<code>PreOrder</code>、<code>BackOrder</code>、<code>Discontinued</code>、<code>InStoreOnly</code>、<code>LimitedAvailability</code>、<code>MadeToOrder</code>、<code>OnlineOnly</code>、<code>PreSale</code>、<code>Reserved</code>、<code>SoldOut</code>，来源：<a href=\"https://schema.org/ItemAvailability\">schema.org/ItemAvailability</a>）。内部状态机若按 schema.org 全集建模，向 Google 分发必须做一次<strong>多对一收缩</strong>：<code>PreSale</code>/<code>MadeToOrder</code> → <code>preorder</code>，<code>Discontinued</code>/<code>SoldOut</code> → <code>out_of_stock</code>。该收缩不可逆，因此能力矩阵要标注每个映射是 <strong>lossy</strong> 还是 <strong>lossless</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"能力矩阵驱动的字段裁剪与降级决策\">能力矩阵驱动的字段裁剪与降级决策</h2><p>有了能力描述符，上架前就能算出一个商品的<strong>可分发闭包</strong>：对渠道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ch</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>、版本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>、属性快照 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>，判定每个属性属于 <code>supported</code>/<code>unsupported</code>/<code>constrained</code> 三态，只有全部必填属性落到 <code>supported</code> 才允许直发。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  P[&quot;商品属性快照&quot;] --&gt; CD[&quot;读取渠道能力描述符&lt;br/&gt;channel@version&quot;]&#10;  CD --&gt; REQ{&quot;必填属性是否齐备?&quot;}&#10;  REQ -- 否 --&gt; DEG{&quot;存在等效替代?&quot;}&#10;  DEG -- 有 GTIN --&gt; A1[&quot;缺 mpn 时用 GTIN 顶替&quot;]&#10;  DEG -- 无替代 --&gt; REJ[&quot;拒绝上架&lt;br/&gt;写入异常队列&quot;]&#10;  REQ -- 是 --&gt; CON{&quot;是否命中字段约束?&quot;}&#10;  CON -- 超长/格式错 --&gt; FIX[&quot;按规则裁剪或截断&quot;]&#10;  CON -- 通过 --&gt; CAT{&quot;类目可落?&quot;}&#10;  CAT -- 否 --&gt; FALL[&quot;兜底类目或人工分发&quot;]&#10;  CAT -- 是 --&gt; SEND[&quot;投递 feed / API&quot;]\">graph TD\n  P[\"商品属性快照\"] --&gt; CD[\"读取渠道能力描述符&lt;br/&gt;channel@version\"]\n  CD --&gt; REQ{\"必填属性是否齐备?\"}\n  REQ -- 否 --&gt; DEG{\"存在等效替代?\"}\n  DEG -- 有 GTIN --&gt; A1[\"缺 mpn 时用 GTIN 顶替\"]\n  DEG -- 无替代 --&gt; REJ[\"拒绝上架&lt;br/&gt;写入异常队列\"]\n  REQ -- 是 --&gt; CON{\"是否命中字段约束?\"}\n  CON -- 超长/格式错 --&gt; FIX[\"按规则裁剪或截断\"]\n  CON -- 通过 --&gt; CAT{\"类目可落?\"}\n  CAT -- 否 --&gt; FALL[\"兜底类目或人工分发\"]\n  CAT -- 是 --&gt; SEND[\"投递 feed / API\"]</pre><p>这张决策图里的每一步都必须是<strong>数据驱动</strong>的，不能是散落的硬编码。降级策略本身也要进能力矩阵：<code>brand</code> 缺失但渠道必填时，是可从供应商主数据回填，还是必须整条拒收？<code>gtin</code> 校验位不合法（GS1 的 mod-10 校验、UPC 的 3-1-3-1 加权、EAN 的 1-3-1-3 加权，来源：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Global_Trade_Item_Number\">Wikipedia: Global Trade Item Number</a>）时是先修正还是在映射层拦截？这些判断在上架路径上是「一行 if」，在多渠道批量场景里是<strong>每天数十万次调用</strong>，只有建模成表才可维护。有效做法是把判定写成纯函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>emit</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mtext>degrade</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mtext>reject</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">decide(a, cap(ch,v)) \\to \\{\\text{emit} \\mid \\text{degrade} \\mid \\text{reject}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">emit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">degrade</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reject</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>——无副作用、可离线回放、可用真实拒审样本做单测；回执里的拒审原因再写回描述符。</p>\n<h2 id=\"版本演进与映射漂移治理\">版本演进与映射漂移治理</h2><p>目录与渠道契约都不是常量，而是<strong>带生效区间的政策事实</strong>。三个 2026 年可核验的节点说明演进速度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Google 类目文件仍以 <code>2021-09-21</code> 为版本标注，但规则持续更新：<code>image_link</code> 的最低分辨率被定为自 <strong>2027-01-31</strong> 起提升到 500×500 像素。</li>\n<li><strong>Content API for Shopping 已于 2026-08-18 停止服务</strong>，2026-09-01 起遇到渐进式错误，迁移目标是 Merchant API（<code>merchantapi.googleapis.com</code>，用 <code>accounts/123456/products/en~US~sku123</code> 这类资源名替代数字 ID，来源：<a href=\"https://developers.google.com/merchant/api/overview\">Merchant API overview</a>）。这不是字段变化，而是<strong>投递契约维度</strong>的变化。</li>\n<li>Shopify taxonomy 季度发布（2026-08 起往回推），其仓库 <code>dist/</code> 目录已宣布于 <strong>2026-10-31</strong> 移除，集成方须改从 GitHub release asset 拉取 gzip 资源。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>落到治理需要三条机制。<strong>其一，版本钉死</strong>：能力矩阵每个条目带 <code>(channel, version, effective_from, effective_to)</code>，回放历史时按交易日期选版本，而不是「现在生效的版本」。<strong>其二，漂移检测进 CI</strong>：定期拉取各渠道最新类目与规格文件，与本地映射表做差集，产出「新增类目未映射」「映射目标已废弃」两类告警。<strong>其三，置信度与人工复核</strong>：自动映射产出的关系带置信度，低置信度条目必须人工确认后才能批量上架。漂移可量化为映射失效率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">drift</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∖</mo><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mtext>valid</mtext></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{drift}(t) = |R_t \\setminus R_{t-1}^{\\text{valid}}| / |R_{t-1}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">drift</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1555em;vertical-align:-0.3064em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4519em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">valid</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3064em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣/∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>——上一版映射中在新版渠道目录下不再合法的比例；超阈值即说明需重跑映射而非逐个修补。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三个目录必须分开建模</strong>：内部目录（运营、高频变更）、标准目录（跨渠道通用语言，GPC brick / Shopify taxonomy）、渠道目录（平台契约，不可控）；映射是带损失的关系，须带版本与方向。</li>\n<li><strong>能力矩阵是数据而非代码</strong>：用能力描述符表达七个维度，把散落的 <code>if (channel)</code> 收敛成可查询、可单测的表。必填性是条件式的：Google 的 <code>brand</code>/<code>gtin</code>/<code>mpn</code> 互为替代依赖，<code>availability</code> 要从 schema.org 的 12 个成员向渠道的 4 个值做有损收缩并标注 lossy。</li>\n<li><strong>判定应是纯函数</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">decide(a, cap(ch,v))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span> 输入商品快照与能力描述符，输出直发/降级/拒绝，可离线回放、可用真实拒审样本回归。</li>\n<li><strong>漂移要主动检测</strong>：目录版本、字段规格、投递契约三者都会变（Content API 已于 2026-08-18 停服、Shopify taxonomy 季度发布），需按生效区间选版本、在 CI 做差集告警。</li>\n<li>上游的分发拓扑与真相源分层见<a href=\"syndication-topology-source-of-truth\">分发拓扑与商品主数据真相源</a>，建联与额度申请见<a href=\"channel-onboarding-entitlement\">渠道接入与权限开通</a>，字段映射落地见<a href=\"../feed-build-transform/feed-schema-field-mapping\">Feed 模式与字段映射</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"渠道目录分类体系与能力矩阵建模","id":"渠道目录分类体系与能力矩阵建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分类体系的三层结构与映射问题","id":"分类体系的三层结构与映射问题"},{"level":2,"text":"渠道能力矩阵的维度建模","id":"渠道能力矩阵的维度建模"},{"level":2,"text":"能力矩阵驱动的字段裁剪与降级决策","id":"能力矩阵驱动的字段裁剪与降级决策"},{"level":2,"text":"版本演进与映射漂移治理","id":"版本演进与映射漂移治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分发拓扑与商品主数据真相源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/syndication-model-channel-catalog/syndication-topology-source-of-truth"},"next":{"title":"渠道接入开通、凭证授权与类目准入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-content-syndication-multichannel-feed-ops/syndication-model-channel-catalog/channel-onboarding-entitlement"}}